  "content": "---\nid: DESIGN-0042\ntitle: \"A cache for the reader\"\nstatus: Draft\nauthor: Test Author\ncreated: 2026-10-01\n---\n\n# DESIGN 0042: A cache for the reader\n\n<!--docz:goals:start-->\n## Goals\n\nWe use **Postgres** for the store,\nand Valkey for the queue.\n<!--docz:goals:end-->\n\n<!--docz:open-questions:start-->\n## Open Questions\n\n### 1. Which cache?\n\n- a. **Valkey.** *(recommendation)*\n- b. Memcached.\n\n### 2. How long a TTL?\n\n- a. **One hour.** *(recommendation)*\n- b. One day.\n\n### 3. Already settled?\n\n- a. Yes.\n\n> **Resolved 2026-10-02: (a).**\n<!--docz:open-questions:end-->\n"
